{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "DialogueNodeTable",
  "description": "对话文本节点，选项决定边；speaker 可为 npc/player/narrator。",
  "key": "id",
  "fields": [
    {
      "name": "id",
      "type": "int",
      "description": "稳定配置 ID",
      "min": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "dialogueId",
      "type": "int",
      "description": "所属对话",
      "ref": "DialogueTable"
    },
    {
      "name": "speaker",
      "type": "enum",
      "description": "说话者",
      "values": [
        "npc",
        "player",
        "narrator"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "text",
      "type": "text",
      "description": "显示正文"
    },
    {
      "name": "choiceIds",
      "type": "int[]",
      "description": "顺序展示的选项；空列表显示结束",
      "ref": "DialogueChoiceTable",
      "default": []
    },
    {
      "name": "shot",
      "type": "enum",
      "description": "镜头构图",
      "values": [
        "pair",
        "npc",
        "player"
      ],
      "default": "pair"
    }
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "dialogueId": 1,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "路上的信已经断了三天。如果你愿意帮忙，我们可以一起找出驿使的去向。",
      "choiceIds": [
        1,
        2,
        3,
        4,
        5,
        6,
        7,
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "dialogueId": 1,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "先备齐弹药。你可以扫清道路，也可以去找驿站书记，听听他还记得什么。",
      "choiceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "shot": "npc"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "dialogueId": 1,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "我曾以为，只要一个人走得足够快，就不需要同行者。后来我明白，有些消息值得等。",
      "choiceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "shot": "npc"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "dialogueId": 1,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "那么，下一程我们一起走。",
      "choiceIds": [],
      "shot": "pair"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "dialogueId": 2,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "驿使留下过一封没有收件人的信。你为什么问起他？",
      "choiceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "shot": "npc"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "dialogueId": 2,
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "信封里是一张旧路线图。他改走了北面的山道。把这个消息带给莱雅吧。",
      "choiceIds": [],
      "shot": "npc"
    }
  ]
}
